WEBVTT

00:00:01.310 --> 00:00:02.640
I was watching a dream...

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.610
A dream of two sisters with a good relationship...

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:12.030
Wearing the same school uniform, going to the same school, and going home to the same house...

00:00:13.030 --> 00:00:19.120
It was a sad dream, because those little happiness will continue repeating forever and ever.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.240
The skies of the twilight with no time
toki no nai tasogare sora

