00:00:58.910 --> 00:01:05.100
I'm taking a trip to eternity
eien no tabi wo shiteru

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:19.310
I continued the search on the cold tip of the finger
tsumetai yubisaki sagashi tsuzuketeta

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:24.680
It's burning from the fragments
kakera kara yaiteru

00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:31.140
Hugging deep in my heart
tsuyoku mune ni dakishimete

00:01:33.670 --> 00:01:38.220
The lost item that I was searching for
sagashiteita nakushimono

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:43.690
Checking for it in both of my hands
ryoute no naka tashikamete

00:01:44.310 --> 00:01:57.070
The time that meets the new morning
atarashii asa ni deau toki ga ugakidasuyo

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:11.810
Do you have any idea what Misaka-san's illness is?

00:02:17.650 --> 00:02:19.900
"What" you say? Isn't it just a common cold?

00:02:21.650 --> 00:02:22.530
Misaka-san only came just once for the school's opening ceremony in the first semester, so...

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:26.240
<b>At the Other Side of the Smile
Misaka-san only came just once for the school's opening ceremony in the first semester, so...</b>

00:02:26.240 --> 00:02:27.110
<b>At the Other Side of the Smile</b>

00:02:27.110 --> 00:02:28.040
Just... once...
<b>At the Other Side of the Smile</b>

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:28.820
Just... once...

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:34.750
I've been absent from school the entire time.

00:02:37.790 --> 00:02:38.620
Kaori...!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.880
What is Shiori's illness!?

00:02:45.420 --> 00:02:48.930
I told you that I don't know any girl named Shiori.

00:02:49.470 --> 00:02:50.640
You're telling such a lie!

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:57.690
I think Aizawa-kun doesn't know this, but although the courtyard is desolated like this at this time,

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:03.230
when the snow melts and it begins to get warmer, it will be filled with more students.

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:08.570
At lunch time, it is the best place to eat a bento.
(T/L Note: Bento = Boxed Lunch)

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:14.290
It would not be persuasive if I said that right now.

00:03:14.990 --> 00:03:15.910
Kaori...

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.080
That... "Shiori" girl you're talking about, what do you think about her?

00:03:20.500 --> 00:03:21.920
"What"...?

00:03:24.090 --> 00:03:25.210
She makes me worry.

00:03:26.880 --> 00:03:28.050
I can't say right now, but...

00:03:28.760 --> 00:03:30.050
I can't leave her alone...

00:03:31.640 --> 00:03:34.470
She's small, and she's like my sister...

00:03:35.640 --> 00:03:36.560
I see...

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:43.520
You too! What do you think about her?!

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.070
I'm going home.

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.370
Yuuichi!

00:03:53.870 --> 00:03:55.950
Hey It's funny!

00:03:58.120 --> 00:04:00.210
There are butterflies, too!

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.330
Hey, Yuuichi, let's play!

00:04:08.050 --> 00:04:10.010
Here, Yuuichi, "Aaa".

00:04:15.800 --> 00:04:17.350
IT'S HOT!!!!!!!!

00:04:17.350 --> 00:04:18.770
MAKOTOOO!!!!!!!!

00:04:18.810 --> 00:04:21.640
Because, because, Yuuichi, you were daydreaming.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.110
Makoto, each person has their personal likes and dislikes.

00:04:29.440 --> 00:04:30.070
Yeees!

00:04:30.070 --> 00:04:30.570
Hello, Minase residence.
Yeees!

00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:31.490
Hello, Minase residence.

00:04:32.910 --> 00:04:33.610
Oh, wait a sec.

00:04:33.610 --> 00:04:34.740
Geez.
Oh, wait a sec.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:36.410
Yuuichi, phone call.

00:04:37.950 --> 00:04:39.410
It's from Kaori.

00:04:44.210 --> 00:04:46.090
What is it that you want to talk about?

00:04:48.590 --> 00:04:50.010
Is it about Shiori?

00:04:52.090 --> 00:04:53.090
About my sister.

00:04:55.390 --> 00:04:58.010
About my one and only...

00:04:58.470 --> 00:04:59.470
...sister.

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:04.560
It's going to be her birthday in a week.

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:09.780
I've been told that she won't live long enough for her next birthday.

00:05:10.900 --> 00:05:12.070
Her birthday...

00:05:13.900 --> 00:05:15.030
What do you mean...?

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:16.740
It's just as I told you.

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:21.540
She has had a weak body since birth...

00:05:22.450 --> 00:05:26.460
The doctors have told me that she probably wouldn't live through her next birthday...

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:29.090
But...

00:05:30.460 --> 00:05:33.300
Recently, her physical condition has gotten a bit better...

00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:38.970
Maybe she'll be able to make her next birthday.

00:05:43.310 --> 00:05:44.940
But, that's all...

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.570
Nothing changes...

00:05:51.030 --> 00:05:54.280
When did Shiori know...

00:05:55.450 --> 00:05:57.200
Last... Christmas...

00:06:11.960 --> 00:06:13.880
I told her...

00:06:15.970 --> 00:06:16.880
Why...

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:19.300
Because she asked...

00:06:48.620 --> 00:06:51.880
I... tried not to see her...

00:06:58.470 --> 00:07:00.680
She's going to be gone... soon...

00:07:01.720 --> 00:07:03.510
She's going to be gone from my sight...

00:07:04.770 --> 00:07:05.850
I know it...

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:08.600
So I thought a sister...

00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:14.320
It would have been better if I didn't have one from the beginning...

00:07:22.490 --> 00:07:23.370
Aizawa-kun...

00:07:23.870 --> 00:07:24.990
That girl...

00:07:25.830 --> 00:07:27.580
What was the point of her being born...?

00:07:56.570 --> 00:07:58.780
Yuuichi, what do you want to do about it?

00:08:00.150 --> 00:08:01.160
I don't know...

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:06.370
Anyway, is there anything I can do?

00:08:09.290 --> 00:08:12.830
Have a wonderful time with Shiori-chan.

00:08:15.590 --> 00:08:19.630
Do many things that are exciting and hopeful,

00:08:20.510 --> 00:08:26.760
to make Shiori-chan's heart fill with fun and happy feelings,

00:08:26.810 --> 00:08:28.640
and to make her smile...

00:08:30.560 --> 00:08:32.310
Fun feelings...

00:08:35.110 --> 00:08:37.360
I was lying.

00:08:40.110 --> 00:08:43.320
My illness isn't a cold.

00:08:45.240 --> 00:08:50.500
Even if I take a lot of medicine, or have many injections, it's an illness that can't be cured.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.840
Yuuichi-san! I have a favor to ask of you.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:06.050
Please treat me like an ordinary girl.

00:09:07.640 --> 00:09:09.930
Only for the week until my birthday.

00:09:11.560 --> 00:09:14.650
There really isn't any cure?

00:09:15.270 --> 00:09:16.360
That seems to be the case.

00:09:17.270 --> 00:09:19.820
If a miracle were to happen, there would be a way.

00:09:21.320 --> 00:09:22.320
A miracle...

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:24.860
But...

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:29.280
It's called a miracle because it won't happen.

00:09:33.500 --> 00:09:35.210
Can you grant my request...?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:38.090
She's the one who's in the courtyard a lot.

00:09:38.210 --> 00:09:40.050
Oh, so she was a student of ours.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:46.930
Actually, I'm better at drawing a portrait.

00:10:02.530 --> 00:10:04.860
Jumbo Mix Parfait Deluxe...!

00:10:05.320 --> 00:10:06.610
Itadakimasu!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:21.380
Even if the size of the ears is different, a rabbit-san is a rabbit-san.

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.670
Still needs improving... it seems.

00:10:24.840 --> 00:10:27.430
I dislike people who say things like that.

00:10:50.010 --> 00:10:52.930
The place where I met Yuuichi-san for the first time...

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:55.440
Yeah, I remember that.

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:59.400
You were dazed when you dropped candies and other things.

00:11:00.150 --> 00:11:03.240
This past week was fun.

00:11:04.240 --> 00:11:07.820
What kind of scene is it in the drama right now?

00:11:09.030 --> 00:11:10.240
Let's see...

00:11:11.660 --> 00:11:13.500
It's almost the last episode.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:20.630
Thank you very much.

00:11:21.710 --> 00:11:22.550
Yeah...

00:11:26.470 --> 00:11:28.510
What time can you be out until today?

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:35.020
You can be out for the entire day today, right?

00:11:35.930 --> 00:11:39.730
Then, let's stay together until the date changes.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.400
Yes!

00:11:44.110 --> 00:11:46.070
Nayuki, what's wrong?

00:11:47.150 --> 00:11:49.200
Are you free right now?

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:52.660
This! Here is your birthday present.

00:11:53.870 --> 00:11:55.620
You like to draw pictures, don't you?

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.040
Thank you very much!

00:12:00.330 --> 00:12:03.170
Would it be okay to draw you, Yuuichi-san?

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:04.380
Me?

00:12:05.510 --> 00:12:08.470
I want to draw Yuuichi-san on my first page.

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:10.800
Sure.

00:12:22.770 --> 00:12:24.020
I'm finished!

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:24.730
Do you want to see it?

00:12:24.730 --> 00:12:26.110
Of course!

00:12:26.650 --> 00:12:28.700
Don't be mad when you see it.

00:12:29.450 --> 00:12:30.570
Don't worry.

00:12:35.080 --> 00:12:36.080
How is it?

00:12:36.410 --> 00:12:39.920
To tell the truth, I think you aren't too good at it.

00:12:40.580 --> 00:12:43.210
As I thought... Is that so?

00:12:43.840 --> 00:12:44.840
As you thought?

00:12:45.920 --> 00:12:47.550
I kinda though that was the case.

00:12:48.550 --> 00:12:49.720
But, I'm happy.

00:12:50.090 --> 00:12:51.090
Really?

00:12:51.220 --> 00:12:55.100
Yeah! To think that I look like this in Shiori's eyes...

00:12:55.100 --> 00:12:59.100
...it's happy but at the same time, it's a bit complicated.

00:12:59.350 --> 00:13:02.520
Those words don't make me very happy...

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.480
No, seriously, I'm happy with it!

00:13:08.820 --> 00:13:09.860
Then I believe you!

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.170
What a beautiful starry sky...

00:13:25.420 --> 00:13:30.380
When I look up at the sky like this, it makes me feel as though time has stopped.

00:13:36.100 --> 00:13:39.350
Even though time doesn't stop in reality...

00:13:52.110 --> 00:13:53.070
It's beautiful...

00:13:57.330 --> 00:13:58.290
Let's dance.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:01.710
You wanted to go to the ball, right?

00:14:02.250 --> 00:14:03.540
So... right now.

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.750
Here, you say?

00:14:07.540 --> 00:14:08.380
Yeah.

00:14:09.420 --> 00:14:10.340
Right here.

00:14:11.670 --> 00:14:12.550
Okay!

00:14:28.020 --> 00:14:31.570
Last Christmas, I gave my sister a stole.

00:14:32.650 --> 00:14:35.450
But, after that, she had a bad spasm...

00:14:36.530 --> 00:14:38.450
It was painful, and it was scary...

00:14:39.450 --> 00:14:40.740
So I informed her.

00:14:41.910 --> 00:14:43.370
I couldn't stop myself from saying it...

00:14:44.370 --> 00:14:47.170
About how long Shiori was expected to live...

00:14:49.040 --> 00:14:51.670
But, she was laughing...

00:14:53.340 --> 00:14:54.800
Even when she realized her fate,

00:14:55.800 --> 00:14:57.720
and even when her body was in pain...

00:14:58.680 --> 00:15:01.850
When I avoided her many times...

00:15:03.480 --> 00:15:08.480
She forgives everything, and she accepts everything,

00:15:10.320 --> 00:15:11.480
and she laughs admirably...!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:21.280
I thought I should have cried...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.040
I should have said "No, this isn't right".

00:15:25.000 --> 00:15:28.000
But she always laughs...!

00:15:31.340 --> 00:15:32.250
Kaori...

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.720
Yuuichi-san,

00:15:40.850 --> 00:15:43.560
was I able to laugh?

00:15:45.100 --> 00:15:48.600
All this time, was I able to laugh?

00:15:50.650 --> 00:15:51.520
Yeah.

00:15:52.980 --> 00:15:54.480
It's because of Yuuichi-san.

00:15:56.190 --> 00:15:57.780
The strong Yuuichi-san...

00:15:58.700 --> 00:16:00.660
The one who's strong is Shiori.

00:16:06.080 --> 00:16:08.080
That is... wrong.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:15.380
I... tried to slit my wrists before.

00:16:17.170 --> 00:16:20.010
That day I first met Yuuichi-san.

00:16:21.550 --> 00:16:24.180
I bought a box cutter knife at the shopping district...

00:16:25.560 --> 00:16:30.900
When I thought that it was my last time shopping, I bought other unnecessary things as well.

00:16:32.310 --> 00:16:36.940
Having done that, I was going home, enjoying the snow scenery...

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:40.070
I was in the middle of doing that...

00:16:54.340 --> 00:16:57.170
I... still remember...

00:16:58.380 --> 00:17:04.510
That night, alone with the lights out in my room, it was quiet...

00:17:06.600 --> 00:17:11.900
I couldn't hear anything, couldn't see anything, couldn't think anything...

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:16.690
It was a night that I felt that I was left alone in this world...

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:25.330
Going home... opening the paper bag that was wet with the snow...

00:17:26.790 --> 00:17:31.160
Grasping the yellow box cutter knife... pushing out the silver blade...

00:17:32.920 --> 00:17:34.580
Putting it against my left wrist...

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:48.470
But suddenly, I unexpectedly heard laughter...

00:17:49.850 --> 00:17:53.230
It was the voice of Yuuichi-san from that afternoon...

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:59.150
That smile... that delightful smile...

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:02.490
That delightful voice...

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:03.700
I started to remember it...

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:08.620
I felt right about then how hopelessly miserable I was...

00:18:19.130 --> 00:18:20.920
Laughing as if you were enchanted...

00:18:22.130 --> 00:18:24.220
And really laughing for a long time...

00:18:27.390 --> 00:18:35.480
My tears that didn't flow when my sister told me I probably wouldn't live to see my next birthday... were flowing.

00:18:50.240 --> 00:18:56.830
I... tried to deny her existence... so she tried to vanish.

00:18:58.960 --> 00:19:02.050
But... she couldn't do it so she cried...

00:19:04.170 --> 00:19:05.380
All alone...

00:19:06.590 --> 00:19:09.140
I started to laugh and my tears that came out didn't stop...

00:19:10.430 --> 00:19:12.430
And I noticed that I continued to cry...

00:19:15.190 --> 00:19:19.940
After I laughed for a while, I couldn't hold the box cutter knife anymore...

00:19:21.270 --> 00:19:25.740
Maybe... that was the miracle...

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.740
I'm weak...

00:19:30.620 --> 00:19:32.700
So I forced my weakness onto Shiori...

00:19:33.080 --> 00:19:34.000
That's not true...

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.420
That's Shiori's strength...

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:42.340
I don't think so...

00:19:43.510 --> 00:19:45.470
Since I'm a weak human being...

00:19:48.840 --> 00:19:53.470
I'm just a weak human being that can only live by depending on someone else...

00:19:54.310 --> 00:19:56.600
Then that's fine...

00:19:59.060 --> 00:20:04.900
Every person has to depend on someone else to live...

00:20:11.490 --> 00:20:15.620
Miracles do have a small chance of happening.

00:20:16.370 --> 00:20:17.660
That's why it's called a miracle.

00:20:18.960 --> 00:20:20.580
"Chance of happening..."

00:20:21.130 --> 00:20:22.170
Just a small chance...

00:20:30.300 --> 00:20:31.340
Idiot!

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:34.930
Shiori, you idiot!

00:20:35.430 --> 00:20:36.470
Onee-chan...

00:20:39.020 --> 00:20:45.230
Wearing the same school uniform, and going to the same school from the same house... we promised that!

00:20:46.230 --> 00:20:48.400
It's not just your dream, Shiori!

00:20:52.320 --> 00:20:53.200
It's also...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.200
It's also my dream!

00:20:57.500 --> 00:20:58.540
Onee-chan...

00:20:59.210 --> 00:21:00.210
Dream...

00:21:01.290 --> 00:21:07.170
Wearing the same school uniform, and going to the same school...

00:21:09.300 --> 00:21:10.720
I want to go!!!

00:21:10.760 --> 00:21:12.140
Shiori!!!

00:21:23.730 --> 00:21:25.980
Kaori, let's go to the department store!

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:27.610
Sorry, I can't.

00:21:27.980 --> 00:21:29.320
What are you so impatient about?

00:21:30.400 --> 00:21:31.360
Going to the hospital...

00:21:31.400 --> 00:21:33.660
My sister, Shiori is waiting.

00:21:33.780 --> 00:21:34.490
Oh.

00:21:34.530 --> 00:21:35.410
See you!

00:21:35.830 --> 00:21:37.740
She doesn't hang out with us anymore.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:39.160
That's fine.

00:21:39.290 --> 00:21:41.540
Since Kaori looks happier than before.

00:21:43.170 --> 00:21:43.750
Yeah, I guess.

00:21:43.750 --> 00:21:44.960
Yuuichi!

00:21:45.340 --> 00:21:46.790
I'm here to pick you up.

00:21:47.420 --> 00:21:48.920
So buy me a nikuman!

00:21:48.960 --> 00:21:50.090
What the hell.

00:21:50.420 --> 00:21:51.590
Don't stick close to me!

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:52.800
It's hot!

00:21:55.260 --> 00:21:56.470
It's really hot.

00:21:56.720 --> 00:21:57.470
Is it a fever?

00:21:57.470 --> 00:21:58.060
Yeah!

00:21:58.640 --> 00:22:00.560
Fever, fever, so nikuman!

00:22:01.430 --> 00:22:02.310
I'm not gonna buy!

00:22:02.350 --> 00:22:03.560
Whaaa!?

00:22:03.560 --> 00:22:06.150
What's so bad!? Buy it! Buy it! The nikuman!

00:22:06.150 --> 00:22:07.400
Hey you! Are you a kid!?
What's so bad!? Buy it! Buy it! The nikuman!

00:22:07.400 --> 00:22:07.940
Hey you! Are you a kid!?

00:22:07.940 --> 00:22:08.320
I'm saying buy it! Yuuichi! Nikuman!!!
Hey you! Are you a kid!?

00:22:08.320 --> 00:22:08.780
I'm saying buy it! Yuuichi! Nikuman!!!

00:22:08.780 --> 00:22:12.950
Aah! I'm saying don't stick with me! Hey! It's hot!
I'm saying buy it! Yuuichi! Nikuman!!!

00:22:25.290 --> 00:22:30.190
In between the flowing clouds
nagareru kunono aimani

00:22:30.550 --> 00:22:35.930
The crawling blue sky
muzuita aozora ga

00:22:36.550 --> 00:22:41.610
Even causes the familiar town
minareta machinami de sae

00:22:41.870 --> 00:22:47.080
To light up
kagayakasete kureru

00:22:47.860 --> 00:22:52.920
Running small back
kaketeku chiisana senaka

00:22:53.180 --> 00:22:58.810
The two at that time were...
anokoro no futariga

00:22:59.220 --> 00:23:04.230
The reason for the spilling pain
koboreru itami no wakewo

00:23:04.490 --> 00:23:09.970
Hidden with innocence
mujyakisa de kakushita

00:23:12.600 --> 00:23:18.340
Time is flowing quietly
tokiwa shizukani nagare

00:23:18.650 --> 00:23:23.970
